  <jpcrp_cor:NotesTaxEffectAccountingConsolidatedFinancialStatementsTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">
&lt;h5 class="smt_head5" style="padding-left:18pt;"&gt;(税効果会計関係)&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;１．繰延税金資産の発生の主な原因別の内訳&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="tbld" style="margin-left:30.1pt;margin-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"&gt;
